          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On April 20, 1996, around 10:20 PM, a witness observed from their apartment a cylindrical flying object with blinking lights underneath. The phenomenon was silent and moved slower than an airplane. Its straight trajectory then became ascending after a half-turn. The total observation duration was approximately 10 minutes. No further information is available on this case.",
